Package: libplugin-hostd-protocol0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: plugin-hostd protocol library, a superset of mod-host's text protocol
 The socket server, line protocol and command dispatch that plugin-hostd and
 omx-clap-host answer their controllers with: mod-host's text protocol, so any
 mod-host client works unchanged.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

Package: libplugin-hostd-protocol-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libplugin-hostd-protocol0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: plugin-hostd protocol library, development files
 Headers, the pkg-config file, the scenario corpus and its runner of
 libplugin-hostd-protocol. The headers have the names and the API of
 libmod-host-protocol's, so a host built against mod-host-protocol changes only
 the package name it asks pkg-config for.
 .
 It also carries the declared protocol: plugin-hostd/protocol.h and the
 headers it includes, the one verb table, the grammar of a line in ABNF, and
 the protocol as JSON, each named by a pkg-config variable.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

Package: python3-plugin-hostd-client
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: python
Depends: python3, ${misc:Depends}
Description: plugin-hostd line protocol, its Python client
 plugin_hostd_client, the Python client of the plugin-hostd line protocol: a
 command is one line ended by a NUL, a reply one NUL-ended line; send,
 try_send (a timeout or a closed peer named, never raised) and expect. The
 transport every test of plugin-hostd, omx-clap-host and the controllers
 imports; the codec of the declared commands and replies is
 plugin_hostd_protocol. plugin-hostd-tests before 0.21.0 carried the same
 module under /usr/libexec/plugin-hostd/tests/lib.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

Package: python3-plugin-hostd-protocol
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: python
Depends: python3, libplugin-hostd-protocol0 (>= 0.5.8~), plugin-hostd-protocol-contract (>= 0.5.8~), omx-clap-core-contract (>= 0.32.3~), omx-contract (>= 3.19.1~), omx-contract-data (>= 3.16.0~), ${misc:Depends}
Description: plugin-hostd protocol, its Python codec
 plugin_hostd_protocol: one codec over the files plugin-hostd-protocol
 installs, which encodes and decodes every command the protocol declares,
 parses the replies, feedback lines and protocol errors, and gives each reply
 code its sentence. A controller speaks the protocol through it and restates
 nothing; the npm package @openmixer/plugin-hostd-client is the same codec in
 TypeScript. The transport is plugin_hostd_client.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

Package: plugin-hostd-protocol-contract
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: omx-contract (>= 3.19.1~), ${misc:Depends}
Breaks: plugin-hostd-contract (<< 0.16.0~)
Description: plugin-hostd protocol, its verbs in omx-contract's contract directory
 data/verbs.json of plugin-hostd-protocol, the verbs and reply codes
 plugin-hostd adds to mod-host's protocol, as the package plugin-hostd-protocol
 of omx-contract's contract directory, under
 /usr/share/omx-contract/contract.d/3/plugin-hostd-protocol. plugin-hostd
 before 0.16.0 carried the same items in its own package.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

